l substantive rule.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"reason":"Footnote 2 marker connecting channel rule to resubmission.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"reason":"Separate post-implementation resubmission obligation and forthcoming guidance.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"reason":"Footnote 3 marker connecting XML and PDF options to e-Cert requirement.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"reason":"Requires Hongkong Post e-Cert for the marked submissions.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The selected control concerns STR submissions by the three expressly defined categories of licensed firms. It does not determine obligations of other reporting persons.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"Licensed firms is expressly defined; STREAMS 2, XML and e-Cert are identified. The technical XML schema and prescribed PDF specification are not supplied.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u1.383","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"Urgent direct contact applies during blackout. Footnote 3 attaches to XML and PDF through their markers; extending it to the web form lacks comparable textual support. Resubmission is a separate obligation, not express permission for alternative channels.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"Required submission and resubmission are distinguished from should register and the blackout instruction to contact JFIU. The text does not say that contact alone completes an STR filing.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"Read the general effective date with the specific 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026. Blackout begins at 12:00am on 28 January and continues until resumption. Date-only expressions cannot directly encode these intraday boundaries.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"Missing schema, prescribed form details and resubmission guidance limit implementation-level conclusions. The four dependency identifiers have no supplied contents or mapping to particular references.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What contents and source references correspond to missing.39ffa0d54487ee68b17a36b8, missing.da4d23ff33f664a99e4bf8cc, missing.f5f807738efdd34996b25ddc and missing.1557ee52aade13863ae98bda?","What technical evidence establishes satisfaction of the e-Cert requirement, including certificate validity and its use for the submission?","Does separate JFIU guidance require subsequent STREAMS 2 filing of urgent reports handled during blackout, and what deadline applies?","What timezone governs the stated times? The supplied text does not expressly identify one."],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The control evaluates an identified STR submission, with actor classification supplied rather than presumed.","The post-launch period begins at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, reading the general effective date together with the specific launch time.","Footnote 3 applies to both marked options, XML and PDF; this circular does not expressly attach it to the web form.","Technical XML schema conformity, test arrangements, registration and substantive STR adequacy are separate controls."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"distinction":"A completed web-form submission through STREAMS 2 without e-Cert can satisfy this selected control; an XML or prescribed-PDF submission without e-Cert cannot. A rival requiring e-Cert for all three methods lacks a footnote marker on option (c), so it is not proposed as an equally supported reading.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR is submitted in XML format; this records format selection, not conformity with the separately supplied schema.","name":"xml_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified submission uploads a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format.","name":"prescribed_pdf_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified submission completes the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"web_form_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is satisfied for the identified submission; mere certificate possession is not presumed sufficient.","name":"ecert_requirement_satisfied","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and xml_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) (and prescribed_pdf_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) web_form_submission))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_firm post_launch_submission)"},"local_id":"r1","questions":["What JFIU specifications establish that the PDF is prescribed and that the e-Cert requirement is met?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the identified STR satisfies the selected post-launch channel, permitted-format and attached e-Cert control; false means at least one of those requirements is unmet. This does not determine overall firm compliance.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, format and e-Cert control"},{"assumptions":["The specific blackout arrangements qualify application of the general calendar-date channel statement.","Direct contact is not treated as proof that JFIU accepted a completed STR."],"citations":[{"quote":"will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"An urgent matter at 8:30am on 2 February remains within the blackout contact arrangement; one at 9:30am falls within the post-launch channel control. Applying the channel rule from midnight without preserving the contact arrangement would disregard the express blackout endpoint.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"r2","questions":["What makes an STR require urgent submission?","What steps beyond direct contact complete urgent reporting during blackout?"],"statement":"The selected blackout arrangement directs licensed firms with STRs requiring urgent submission to contact JFIU by the listed means until 9:00am on 2 February 2026. The source does not specify a complete filing procedure or establish that contact itself constitutes submission.","subject":"Urgent blackout contact exception"},{"assumptions":["Following implementation refers to the stated launch instant.","Resubmission is a separate obligation; its existence does not establish that the initial channel choice was compliant.","No deadline or completed-resubmission fact is inferred."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"An STR emailed to JFIU after launch triggers the express resubmission obligation. An urgent blackout contact before launch is not brought within that obligation by footnote 2 alone. Whether separate guidance requires later filing remains unresolved.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR was submitted to JFIU, rather than merely being the subject of an inquiry or attempted contact.","name":"submitted_to_jfiu","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and submitted_to_jfiu post_launch_submission (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"licensed_firm"},"local_id":"r3","questions":["What deadline and procedural requirements does the promised resubmission guidance impose?","Does that guidance address reports made during blackout?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, true means the express footnote 2 trigger for mandatory STREAMS 2 resubmission is satisfied; false means that trigger is not established by the supplied facts. The result does not determine whether resubmission has occurred or whether the initial submission complied.","subject":"Footnote 2 resubmission trigger"}]},"controlled-language":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Defines the actors included in licensed firms.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"reason":"Identifies STREAMS 2 and its replacement of STREAMS; analytical benefits are background.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383"},{"reason":"Heading identifies the submission provisions.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795"},{"reason":"Establishes the exclusive channel, effective date and required submission methods.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"reason":"Permits XML submission and attaches footnote 3.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"reason":"Permits completed prescribed PDF uploads and attaches footnote 3.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"reason":"Permits completion of the web-based form without a footnote 3 marker.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"reason":"Account registration heading.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203"},{"reason":"Registration facilitation and instructions are outside the selected submission control; their email channel is not an STR filing alternative.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235"},{"reason":"Transitional arrangements heading.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580"},{"reason":"Introduces transitional arrangements using should; specific required provisions retain their express modality.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614"},{"reason":"Defines the blackout boundaries and resumption time.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"reason":"Preserves urgent direct contact during the blackout.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"reason":"Fixes launch at 9:00am and distinguishes migration of earlier records from resubmission.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"reason":"Adds XML schema and technical-test liaison requirements, dependent on missing material.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"reason":"General query contact, not an additional submission channel.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675"},{"reason":"Issuer division identification.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852"},{"reason":"Issuer identification.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879"},{"reason":"Document end marker.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914"},{"reason":"Document reference identifier.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919"},{"reason":"Historical introduction dates and reference to presentation material; not commencement dates.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943"},{"reason":"First fragment of the presentation URL; target content is not supplied.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157"},{"reason":"Continuation of the presentation URL; target content is not supplied.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"reason":"Footnote marker links the exclusive-channel provision to resubmission.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"reason":"Creates a separate obligation for post-implementation submissions through other channels.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"reason":"Footnote marker connects XML and PDF methods to the certificate requirement.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"reason":"Requires Hongkong Post e-Cert for the marked submission methods; implementation details are absent.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"dimensions":[{"dimension":"scope","explanation":"The selected control concerns individual STR filings by the three specified classes of licensed firms. The general only-channel sentence does not justify extending this proposal to other actors.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"definitions","explanation":"Licensed firms is expressly defined. XML, prescribed PDF, web form and Hongkong Post e-Cert identify methods and credentials, but technical specifications and what constitutes satisfying the certificate requirement are incomplete.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"exceptions","explanation":"Urgent direct contact belongs to the blackout arrangements. Footnote 3 attaches to XML and PDF; the supplied text does not attach it to the web form. Resubmission is a corrective obligation, not express permission to choose another channel.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"Required and only establish the submission requirements. Should and please appear in registration and transition instructions; their presence does not erase the express XML and resubmission requirements. The urgent-contact wording does not establish that contact alone completes filing.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"The general effective date is 2 February 2026, while launch and resumption are expressly at 9:00am that day. The selected post-launch control uses that launch boundary and preserves the blackout beginning at 12:00am on 28 January. The source does not specify a time zone or a resubmission deadline.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"The XML schema, prescribed PDF specifications, registration form, presentation and future resubmission guidance are not supplied in full. Four missing dependency identifiers have no supplied mapping to particular references, so their contents cannot be inferred.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["What acts satisfy the e-Cert requirement for XML and PDF: possession, authentication, signing, or another specified use?","What time zone governs the blackout and launch times, and does following implementation in footnote 2 mean the stated 9:00am launch?","Does urgent blackout contact constitute submission, and what later filing procedure applies to reports handled through that contact?","What do the missing XML schema, prescribed PDF specifications and resubmission guidance require, including any resubmission deadline?","Which supplied references correspond to the four missing dependency identifiers?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The assessed item is one STR filing or attempted filing.","Post-launch means at or after the stated 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026; it is supplied as a Boolean because the expression language has no timestamp type.","The certificate requirement attaches to the two methods carrying footnote 3. No competing web-form certificate requirement is supported by this packet."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"distinction":"This selected control tests channel, listed format and attached certificate requirement for one post-launch filing. It does not decide XML schema compliance, registration, STR substance, timeliness or remedial resubmission. The strongest unresolved issue is the operational meaning of requiring e-Cert.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The submitting actor falls within the supplied definition of licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed STR filing occurs at or after the stated 9:00am launch on 2 February 2026, using the applicable time zone once established.","name":"post_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed STR is submitted to the JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams_2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission is an STR in XML format; this fact alone does not establish compliance with the separately provided schema.","name":"xml_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission uploads a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format.","name":"prescribed_pdf_upload","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission completes the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"completed_web_form","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement in footnote 3; mere possession is not assumed sufficient.","name":"ecert_requirement_satisfied","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and via_streams_2 (or completed_web_form (and xml_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) (and prescribed_pdf_upload ecert_requirement_satisfied)))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_firm post_launch)"},"local_id":"reading_1","questions":["What evidence establishes satisfaction of footnote 3?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the individual filing satisfies the selected post-launch channel, format and attached e-Cert control: it uses STREAMS 2 and either completes its web form, submits XML with the required e-Cert, or uploads a completed prescribed PDF with the required e-Cert. False means this selected control is not satisfied; an unknown input remains unknown.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, format and e-Cert control"},{"assumptions":["The expressly timed transition provisions qualify application of the general calendar-date channel provision during the blackout."],"citations":[{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"Urgent blackout contact is a separate transitional instruction. Treating it as a post-launch alternative filing channel, or treating contact as completed filing, would add an outcome the text does not state.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_2","questions":["What establishes urgency, and what procedure follows direct contact?","Are reports contacted about during the blackout later subject to an express filing or resubmission instruction?"],"statement":"For STRs requiring urgent submission during the stated blackout, the text directs contact with the JFIU by the listed email, phone or fax. This includes the pre-launch hours of 2 February 2026. The packet does not establish whether contact itself completes submission; exact timestamp boundaries and that outcome are not formalized.","subject":"Blackout urgent-contact exception"},{"assumptions":["Following implementation is provisionally read against the expressly stated launch time.","The obligation is assessed separately from the initial channel control."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"The text imposes a corrective duty after an off-channel submission; it does not say that later resubmission retroactively satisfies the initial channel requirement. Automatic migration of previous STREAMS records is a different arrangement.","family":"modality","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_3","questions":["When must resubmission occur, and what evidence links it to the original STR?","Does the promised guidance address blackout contacts?"],"statement":"A licensed firm that submits an STR to the JFIU through another channel following implementation must separately re-submit that STR through STREAMS 2. No completion deadline or retrospective cure of the original channel failure is specified.","subject":"Separate off-channel resubmission obligation"},{"assumptions":["Intending to submit via XML is the stated trigger, which can arise before an actual filing.","Arranging a technical test is distinct from proving that a test has passed."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"}],"distinction":"Choosing a permitted XML format under the selected filing control does not exhaust XML-specific duties. The text requires schema conformity and prompt liaison, but does not expressly make successful test completion a filing prerequisite.","family":"dependencies","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_4","questions":["What schema version applies?","How is as soon as possible assessed, and does separate guidance impose a test-passing prerequisite?"],"statement":"Licensed firms intending to submit XML STRs must follow the separately provided JFIU schema and liaise with the JFIU as soon as possible to arrange a technical test. Missing schema contents and the contextual timing standard prevent a complete executable determination here.","subject":"XML schema and technical-test liaison dependencies"}]},"normative":{"coverage":[{"reason":"Used as actor-scope definition and transition context.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"reason":"Used as platform replacement definition and contextual background.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383"},{"reason":"Used as heading for the selected STR-submission control.","status":"CONTEXT","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795"},{"reason":"Used as mandatory channel rule and effective-date evidence.","status":"INTERPRETED","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"reason":"Used as XML method