 blackout contact is an STR submission or state a resubmission deadline.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"modality","explanation":"“are required to submit” and “are required to follow” express mandatory wording. Registration and transitional arrangements use “should”; urgent contact uses “please contact”. The packet does not establish the legal consequence of each formulation beyond preserving the wording.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"status":"PROPOSED"},{"dimension":"time","explanation":"One reading treats “following its implementation” as beginning at the 9:00am launch on 2026-02-02. A competing reading treats the general date “With effect from 2 February 2026” as the resubmission boundary, while retaining the blackout until 9:00am. The source does not specify a timezone.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"},{"dimension":"dependencies","explanation":"XML conformity depends on a separately provided JFIU schema, and the source promises resubmission guidance. The webinar presentation URL is supplied only in fragments. The contents of these materials are unavailable, so their requirements cannot be inferred.","source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"status":"AMBIGUOUS"}],"questions":["Does “following its implementation” mean the 9:00am launch or the calendar date 2026-02-02?","When does urgent blackout contact constitute an actual STR submission?","What technical act satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement?","Which timezone governs the stated times?","What are the contents of the separately provided XML schema and promised resubmission guidance?"],"readings":[{"assumptions":["The selected control is evaluated only for a classified licensed firm and an actual STR filing.","Unknown facts remain unknown rather than being treated as false.","Footnote 3 attaches to the XML and prescribed-PDF items because those items carry the marker; the web-form item does not carry it."],"citations":[{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"Operational-launch reading: “following its implementation” begins at the explicit 9:00am STREAMS 2 launch. An off-channel STR filed at or after that time triggers the separate resubmission obligation. The strongest uncertainty is that footnote 2 does not expressly define implementation by reference to the launch time.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event classification"},{"meaning":"The filing occurs at or after the 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02.","name":"at_or_after_operational_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification"},{"meaning":"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel classification"},{"meaning":"The XML submission conforms to the separately provided JFIU XML schema.","name":"xml_schema_conforms","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean technical conformity assessment"},{"meaning":"The selected method is a completed prescribed PDF upload.","name":"is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The selected method is completion of the STREAMS 2 web form.","name":"is_completed_streams2_web_form","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean method classification"},{"meaning":"The footnote 3 Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is met for the assessed XML or PDF submission.","name":"submission_ecert_requirement_met","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean certificate-requirement assessment"}],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and is_xml_submission xml_schema_conforms submission_ecert_requirement_met) (and is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload submission_ecert_requirement_met) is_completed_streams2_web_form))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing at_or_after_operational_launch)"},"local_id":"operational_launch","questions":["Does the source intend the launch timestamp, including its timezone, to define implementation?","Does an urgent contact made before launch later require resubmission, and by when?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within the selected scope, true means the filing uses STREAMS 2 and one listed method, with XML schema conformity where XML is used and the footnote 3 e-Cert requirement met for XML or PDF. False means this selected control is not satisfied; it does not decide whole-firm compliance or STR timeliness.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, method and certificate control"},{"assumptions":["The general effective-date clause supplies the resubmission boundary at the start of 2026-02-02.","The blackout contact arrangement remains applicable until 9:00am, when STREAMS 2 resumes.","The selected control still requires STREAMS 2 for filings within its scope."],"citations":[{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"following its implementation","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}],"distinction":"Calendar-date reading: the date-only effective clause governs the resubmission trigger, so an off-channel STR filed on 2026-02-02 before 9:00am could trigger later resubmission even though STREAMS 2 was not yet accepting submissions. This is less closely aligned with the explicit launch-time wording. It does not convert blackout contact into STREAMS 2 availability.","family":"time","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor belongs to one of the classes collectively called licensed firms.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification"},{"meaning":"The event is an actual STR filing to the JFIU.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean event classification"},{"meaning":"Gregorian calendar date of the filing.","name":"filing_date","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"date","unit":"Gregorian date YYYY-MM-DD"},{"meaning":"The filing is made through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel classification"}],"result":"(and (>= filing_date (date 2026-02-02)) (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing)"},"local_id":"calendar_date","questions":["Does “with effect from 2 February 2026” apply at 00:00 or only when STREAMS 2 launches?","Does the promised guidance require resubmission of a filing communicated during the blackout?","What evidence establishes that a direct contact was an STR filing?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within the selected scope, true means an STR filed outside STREAMS 2 on or after 2026-02-02 falls within the proposed separate resubmission trigger. False means this proposed calendar-date trigger is not satisfied. It does not determine whether resubmission has occurred or whether the original filing was compliant.","subject":"Calendar-date resubmission trigger"}]}},"java_checks":[{"node_id":"node.5d8c4ca625a46c41ff2f4098","result":{"build_manifest":{"bundle_hash":"a9508ffd7220b03971eabd003bd75f96d6ae52d0dd1ec2155003b51be9df4fd6","command":["javac","--release","17","-encoding","UTF-8","-g:none","-Xlint:all","-Werror","-d","classes","EventReplay.java","Json.java","Policy.java","Policy_a9508ffd7220b03971ea.java","Runner.java","SyntheticHost.java"],"compiler":"javac 17.0.20.1","decision_engine":"legalmath-java/0.1.0","dependencies":["Java SE 17"],"event_engine":"legalmath-java-events/0.1.0","generated_sha256":"67f6b48add25996034cd3914c26dd8a1aa93c43e20fedf1a6d33e1c8319a076c","jar_sha256":"d01f9ba81a271bed965f34441ae3a8464042ba2bce45199f6a3471319aa1f176","java_target":17,"licenses":["Project-authored runtime; deployment license review pending"],"record_type":"JavaBuildManifest","runtime_sha256":"359076c6e4642c4efdb82a36852770bc4e58cd95ac6fe84576f84f74509db072","source_hashes":["63957c97961f486576f1ba5d508a3514afd355f8914fff1be1d6d6af8128ed45"]},"cases":24,"legal_source_commitment_resolved":false