ad4e68.u14.2439"}],"distinction":"Choosing a permitted XML format under the selected filing control does not exhaust XML-specific duties. The text requires schema conformity and prompt liaison, but does not expressly make successful test completion a filing prerequisite.","family":"dependencies","formalization":null,"local_id":"reading_4","questions":["What schema version applies?","How is as soon as possible assessed, and does separate guidance impose a test-passing prerequisite?"],"statement":"Licensed firms intending to submit XML STRs must follow the separately provided JFIU schema and liaise with the JFIU as soon as possible to arrange a technical test. Missing schema contents and the contextual timing standard prevent a complete executable determination here.","subject":"XML schema and technical-test liaison dependencies"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.d2ff2a2cac0086fe5b2c2725","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"6444833ee91e09d7201599ca17e2b5d88748ad53cb2844df86a3a9ed0d8626f0","candidate_id":"candidate.e335db0b2c084684a6aafc6b387ec1be","commitment":"91c869d719c8872846f5adba4305908bb529a3b6154d6b5d105762022ecc7759","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.91c869d719c8872846f5adba","order":6,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The control evaluates an identified STR submission, with actor classification supplied rather than presumed.","The post-launch period begins at 9:00am on 2 February 2026, reading the general effective date together with the specific launch time.","Footnote 3 applies to both marked options, XML and PDF; this circular does not expressly attach it to the web form.","Technical XML schema conformity, test arrangements, registration and substantive STR adequacy are separate controls."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}],"distinction":"A completed web-form submission through STREAMS 2 without e-Cert can satisfy this selected control; an XML or prescribed-PDF submission without e-Cert cannot. A rival requiring e-Cert for all three methods lacks a footnote marker on option (c), so it is not proposed as an equally supported reading.","family":"exceptions","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR is submitted in XML format; this records format selection, not conformity with the separately supplied schema.","name":"xml_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified submission uploads a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format.","name":"prescribed_pdf_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified submission completes the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"web_form_submission","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement is satisfied for the identified submission; mere certificate possession is not presumed sufficient.","name":"ecert_requirement_satisfied","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and xml_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) (and prescribed_pdf_submission ecert_requirement_satisfied) web_form_submission))","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and licensed_firm post_launch_submission)"},"local_id":"r1","questions":["What JFIU specifications establish that the PDF is prescribed and that the e-Cert requirement is met?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the identified STR satisfies the selected post-launch channel, permitted-format and attached e-Cert control; false means at least one of those requirements is unmet. This does not determine overall firm compliance.","subject":"Post-launch STR channel, format and e-Cert control"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.91c869d719c8872846f5adba","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.ba7840c62641415fa256b7049bfe5726","commitment":"c8e005eb37a38e37e6a09f740c24f06a39a10ddb619f904bc8eb08ac68c6d205","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":{"code":"E_UNSUPPORTED_PROFILE","details":"None"},"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.c8e005eb37a38e37e6a09f74","order":7,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The specific blackout arrangements qualify application of the general calendar-date channel statement.","Direct contact is not treated as proof that JFIU accepted a completed STR."],"citations":[{"quote":"will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS, please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"}],"distinction":"An urgent matter at 8:30am on 2 February remains within the blackout contact arrangement; one at 9:30am falls within the post-launch channel control. Applying the channel rule from midnight without preserving the contact arrangement would disregard the express blackout endpoint.","family":"time","formalization":null,"local_id":"r2","questions":["What makes an STR require urgent submission?","What steps beyond direct contact complete urgent reporting during blackout?"],"statement":"The selected blackout arrangement directs licensed firms with STRs requiring urgent submission to contact JFIU by the listed means until 9:00am on 2 February 2026. The source does not specify a complete filing procedure or establish that contact itself constitutes submission.","subject":"Urgent blackout contact exception"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.c8e005eb37a38e37e6a09f74","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"5a5f1c7a584df5113cbf903dbd9eedd8d6edc5a97dbe2a640593650c4c0645f7","candidate_id":"candidate.954f9a9cbe634391a845b5e37bd68d66","commitment":"29b224046d115582fbf223fb7c4dd5c98ac7cce593c6a5ecee1d9710a429face","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.29b224046d115582fbf223fb","order":8,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["Following implementation refers to the stated launch instant.","Resubmission is a separate obligation; its existence does not establish that the initial channel choice was compliant.","No deadline or completed-resubmission fact is inferred."],"citations":[{"quote":"For STRs submitted to the JFIU via channels other than STREAMS 2 following its implementation, licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"upon the launch of STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2 February 2026","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"}],"distinction":"An STR emailed to JFIU after launch triggers the express resubmission obligation. An urgent blackout contact before launch is not brought within that obligation by footnote 2 alone. Whether separate guidance requires later filing remains unresolved.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The actor for the identified STR falls within the circular's defined licensed firms.","name":"licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission occurs at or after the stated STREAMS 2 launch instant, 9:00am on 2 February 2026; supplied using an externally resolved timezone.","name":"post_launch_submission","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR submission is made to JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The identified STR was submitted to JFIU, rather than merely being the subject of an inquiry or attempted contact.","name":"submitted_to_jfiu","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and submitted_to_jfiu post_launch_submission (not via_streams2))","result_type":"bool","scope":"licensed_firm"},"local_id":"r3","questions":["What deadline and procedural requirements does the promised resubmission guidance impose?","Does that guidance address reports made during blackout?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] Within scope, true means the express footnote 2 trigger for mandatory STREAMS 2 resubmission is satisfied; false means that trigger is not established by the supplied facts. The result does not determine whether resubmission has occurred or whether the initial submission complied.","subject":"Footnote 2 resubmission trigger"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.29b224046d115582fbf223fb","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0},{"bundle_hash":"c999b7feb78291eab7921c46bbb28978bb071d6e4bc87f40da2a38cca599315b","candidate_id":"candidate.949aa84d314d40508a2f6fba4ceb551e","commitment":"e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5fd4703affad0b8cf78b16658eda6b3a230deb41e","depth":0,"disposition":"UNREVIEWED","encoding_error":null,"expanded":false,"issued_calls":0,"node_id":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5","order":9,"parent":null,"reading":{"assumptions":["The filing entity is classified separately under the circular's definition of licensed firms; no classification is inferred from its use of STREAMS 2.","The specific 9:00am launch and resumption provision determines the post-launch boundary for this model when read with the general effective-date provision.","Each assessed event has an identifiable submission method; a later resubmission is a separate event.","Footnote 3 applies to the XML and PDF alternatives carrying its marker. No e-Cert requirement for the web-based alternative is inferred from this footnote.","Certificate satisfaction means that a Hongkong Post e-Cert is supplied or used for this particular submission in the required manner; mere firm-level possession does not establish that fact.","The result covers only the selected channel, method and certificate requirements. It does not decide the STR's substantive adequacy, filing timeliness, XML schema conformity, technical testing or overall legal compliance."],"citations":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2. Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026, and will resume accepting STR submissions at 9:00am on 2 February 2026 via STREAMS 2","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"licensed firms that intend to submit STRs via the XML format are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU and liaise with it as soon as possible to arrange a technical test to ensure a smooth transition.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"}],"distinction":"A single fact such as electronic_submission would conceal the distinction between channel and format, while firm_has_ecert would conceal the submission-specific certificate requirement. XML and PDF require both the STREAMS 2 channel and the footnote 3 certificate condition. The retained text does not attach that certificate condition to the web-based alternative. The blackout is excluded from this ordinary post-launch rule.","family":"dependencies","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The entity responsible for the assessed submission is a licensed corporation, SFC-licensed virtual asset service provider or associated entity within the circular's collective definition.","name":"filer_is_licensed_firm","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean classification of the filing entity"},{"meaning":"The assessed submission occurred at or after 9:00am on 2 February 2026 in the timezone governing the circular. This is an event-time comparison supplied as a fact because the expression language has no timestamp type.","name":"submission_at_or_after_launch","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean temporal classification of one submission event"},{"meaning":"The assessed STR submission was made to the JFIU through STREAMS 2, rather than through another channel.","name":"submitted_to_jfiu_via_streams2","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean channel observation for one submission event"},{"meaning":"The STR was submitted in Extensible Markup Language format. This fact does not assert conformity with the separately provided JFIU XML schema.","name":"submission_uses_xml","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean format observation for one submission event"},{"meaning":"The submission method was uploading an STR form that was completed and was in the prescribed PDF format; uploading an arbitrary PDF is insufficient.","name":"completed_prescribed_pdf_uploaded","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean assessment of the uploaded form and submission action"},{