ted prescribed PDF form with that e-Cert, or the completed STREAMS 2 web-based STR form. False means that at least one of these selected requirements was not met. An unknown input remains unknown, and an out-of-scope event receives no compliance verdict. This answers only whether the assessed submission meets the selected channel, method and footnote 3 requirements; it confers no legal approval.","subject":"Post-launch channel, submission method and method-specific e-Cert requirements"},"repair_needed":false,"reward":0,"root":"node.e527b70be44a95d97a2e5ae5","roundtrip_done":false,"visits":0}],"pending":null,"provider_id":"codex.fresh.v1.compact.v1","retrievals":[],"rounds":0,"roundtrips":[],"run_id":"run.dcbd61031fd641e78a366a51ca9ca587","stop":null}